comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T04:41:16.972Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check before create: pm-z9x1r2 owns auto-DETECTION and the precedence chain, not the value domain of what gets written; pm-6uxhe0 is CLOSED and covered author_default suppressing detection, a single mechanism rather than the accumulated vocabulary; pm-42p9nk is CLOSED and covered call sites that bypassed the resolver; pm-h90s and pm-cpja are CLOSED and covered unknown-author enforcement and ergonomics; pm-zqpnte owns disposition of the five unknown-author events. None of them owns the 477-spelling domain or a read-time canonicalization policy over an unrewritable record. Searched keyword and semantic for author identity vocabulary, canonical spellings, governance; the census is reproducible by parsing the author field of every line under .agents/pm/history."
  "2026-08-02T23:02:32.156Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: versioned read-time vocabulary projection is live without rewriting immutable authors or hashes. The repository-wide 43,561-entry activity report exposes vocabulary_version=1 and a bounded top-20 unresolved residual (34,210 rows), led by codex-agent 8,492, maintainer-agent 5,330, claude-code-agent 3,631, and codex-root 2,281. This is now explicit context data rather than an inferred or hidden rewrite target."
  "2026-08-02T23:56:41.374Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: repository-wide coverage passed 422/422 files and 6,747/6,747 tests at exact 100/100/100/100. Versioned vocabulary interpretation preserves immutable author literals; sparse settings normalize at the settings boundary. pnpm lint/typecheck and SDK/public contract gates passed. Current npm and pm-changelog registry versions are both 2026.8.2; a single v2026.8.2 auto-release exists for 2026-08-02. pnpm audit could not reach the npm advisory endpoint after retries; GitHub security APIs independently report zero open dependency, code-scanning, or secret-scanning alerts."
  "2026-08-03T00:02:29.760Z","harness:codex","Acceptance evidence: unrelated npm SDK consumer interpreted legacy author 'legacy' as canonical harness 'codex' with vocabulary_version=2 without mutating the entry, and bounded summary returned the inspected count. Packed npm and Bun/bunx CLI flows passed from /tmp/tmp.RUUVnIHTaz."
  "2026-08-03T00:47:52.730Z","harness:codex","Merged delivery evidence: PR #874 merged to main as b1f70ab1aa196ceea261a1154c53b1e7dcdd4e45 after exact-head checks were all successful. Final review inventory had zero unresolved threads and zero unacknowledged bot comments/reviews."
